<title>USA: Ashland Coal mtg, merger vote set for June 3.</title>
<headline>Ashland Coal mtg, merger vote set for June 3.</headline>
<dateline>HUNTINGTON, W.Va. 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ashland Coal Inc said Monday it has called a special shareholder meeting June 30 to vote on its proposed merger with St. Louis-based Arch Mineral Corp.</p>
<p>The meeting wil be held at 0900 EDT/1300 GMT at the corporate offices of Ashland Coal in Huntington, W. Va. Shareholders of record as of June 5, 1997, will be eligible to vote at the meeting. At least 85 percent of the shares voting must approve the merger for it to go through.</p>
</text>
